IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `uro-nouns`

-- Social Security Benefits Up-rating Order 2026 (S.I. 2026/148): PART 4, ARTICLES 25 TO 28, WITH SCHEDULES 8 TO 10.
-- Layer 1. Articles 25 to 27 amend the Jobseeker's Allowance Regulations 1996 and article 28 the Jobseeker's Allowance
-- Regulations 2013; neither is among the inputs. Every figure the Order states is a value. The conditions the Schedules
-- attach to a figure ("to whom regulation 59, 60 or 61 applies", "satisfies the condition in paragraph 13(1)(a)") are
-- tests in the Regulations, so each is a plain input named for the fact.
-- Dates: arts 25, 26 and 27 come into force on the first day of the beneficiary's first benefit week to commence on or
-- after 6th April 2026 (art 1(3)(i)); art 28 likewise (art 1(3)(j), and art 1(4) for unearned income under universal
-- credit): uro-part1-intro.
-- Article 26(1) ("a reference in this article to a numbered regulation or Schedule is a reference to ...") is a
-- cross-reference convention and is not encoded.

§ `Article 25 -- Increase in age-related amounts of contribution-based Jobseeker's Allowance`

-- src:310 | In regulation 79(1) of the JSA Regulations 1996 (weekly amounts of contribution-based jobseeker’s allowance)—
-- src:311 | (a) in sub-paragraph (a) for “£72.90” substitute “£75.65”; and
@ref art 25(a) (src:310-311)
`art 25(a): regulation 79(1)(a) of the JSA Regulations 1996, the weekly amount` MEANS `a sum and its replacement` OF 72.90, 75.65

-- src:312 | (b) in sub-paragraph (c) for “£92.05” substitute “£95.55”.
@ref art 25(b) (src:312)
`art 25(b): regulation 79(1)(c) of the JSA Regulations 1996, the weekly amount` MEANS `a sum and its replacement` OF 92.05, 95.55

@ref art 25 (src:310-312)
DECLARE `a sub-paragraph of regulation 79(1) of the JSA Regulations 1996` IS ONE OF
    `JSA 1996 regulation 79(1)(a)`
    `JSA 1996 regulation 79(1)(c)`

@ref art 25 (src:310-312)
GIVEN `which one` IS A `a sub-paragraph of regulation 79(1) of the JSA Regulations 1996`
GIVETH A `a sum and its replacement`
`art 25: the replaced and the replacing sum` `which one` MEANS
    CONSIDER `which one`
    WHEN `JSA 1996 regulation 79(1)(a)` THEN `art 25(a): regulation 79(1)(a) of the JSA Regulations 1996, the weekly amount`
    WHEN `JSA 1996 regulation 79(1)(c)` THEN `art 25(b): regulation 79(1)(c) of the JSA Regulations 1996, the weekly amount`


