-- src:727 | | (4) Severe Disability Premium where one member of a joint-claim couple satisfies the condition in paragraph 20I(1)— | (4) | |
-- src:728 | | (i) | if there is someone in receipt of a carer’s allowance or carer support payment, or if either member satisfies that condition only by virtue of paragraph 20I(4); | (i) | £86.05; |
-- src:729 | | (ii) | if no-one is in receipt of such an allowance or payment. | (ii) | £172.10. |
@ref Sch 10 (4) (src:727-729)
GIVEN `one member of the joint-claim couple satisfies the condition in paragraph 20I(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `someone is in receipt of a carer's allowance or carer support payment, or either member satisfies that condition only by virtue of paragraph 20I(4)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`Sch 10 (4): the severe disability premium for a joint-claim couple` `one member of the joint-claim couple satisfies the condition in paragraph 20I(1)` `someone is in receipt of a carer's allowance or carer support payment, or either member satisfies that condition only by virtue of paragraph 20I(4)` MEANS
